#: ../../source/gensync_README.md:63
msgid "gensync(generatorFnOrOptions)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/gensync_README.md:65
msgid ""
"Returns a function that can be \"await\"-ed in another `gensync` "
"generator function, or executed via"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/gensync_README.md:68
msgid "`.sync(...args)` - Returns the computed value, or throws."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/gensync_README.md:69
msgid "`.async(...args)` - Returns a promise for the computed value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/gensync_README.md:70
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`.errback(...args, (err, result) => {})` - Calls the callback with the "
